    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present No. 4 Cypress Lawn to the market, a truly special three-bedroom home superbly positioned within this mature, peaceful and highly sought-after residential enclave. Offering an exceptional balance of space, privacy and convenience, this charming property will appeal to a wide range of purchasers seeking a well-located home.\n\nNo. 4 has been lovingly maintained for +40 years by its current owners and is presented in very good decorative order throughout. The property enjoys bright, well-proportioned accommodation with a wonderful sense of warmth and comfort evident from the moment you step inside. Each room has been thoughtfully designed to maximise natural light and functionality, creating a home perfectly suited to modern living.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a spacious sitting room ideal for relaxing or entertaining, and a generously proportioned kitchen/dining room to the rear with access to the garden and garage and a convenient downstairs WC. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms, offering excellent storage and comfortable accommodation, while a spacious family bathroom completes the first-floor layout. A versatile attic space with useful eaves storage further enhances the practicality of the home and offers excellent additional space for a variety of uses.\n\nFor those working remotely or seeking additional flexibility, the property presents excellent potential for a dedicated home office. The existing office and utility area could easily be transformed into a spacious and comfortable work-from-home environment, perfectly suited to modern lifestyles.\n\nOutside, both the front and rear gardens are a particular feature of this wonderful home. To the front, there is extensive off-street parking, providing excellent practicality and convenience. The rear garden is exceptionally private and enjoys a wonderful sense of seclusion. Beautifully designed with great flair and imagination, this outdoor space offers the ideal setting for al fresco dining, entertaining guests or simply relaxing in peaceful surroundings.\n\nThe location of No. 4 Cypress Lawn is second to none, enjoying an almost unparalleled sense of convenience. Situated within walking distance of a range of local shops and amenities, the property is also close to both Templeogue and Terenure Villages, Rathfarnham Shopping Centre and is within easy commuting distance of Dublin City Centre and the M50 road network. The ever-popular Bushy Park is just a short stroll away, while numerous sporting clubs, golf courses and recreational amenities are all within easy reach.\n\nCombining generous accommodation, beautiful outdoor space and an enviable location, No. 4 Cypress Lawn represents a superb opportunity to acquire a wonderful home in a highly desirable residential setting.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this exceptional property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1.51m x 0.71m\nPorch with sliding door and a tiled floor.\n\nHall - 1.82m x 5.45m\nHall features recessed lighting, alarm control panel and storage.\n\nSitting Room - 3.64m x 6.15m\nSitting room features a laminate flooring, open fire, ceiling coving and recessed lighting.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 3.51m x 6.15m\nFeatures a tiled floor, tiled splashback, built-in kitchen units, a stainless steel sink, Samsung fridge freezer, Neff extractor fan, induction hob and double oven, recessed lighting and access to the rear garden.\n\nWC - 1.30m x 0.80m\nFully tiled with recessed lighting, WC and wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.64m x 3.32m\nDouble bedroom to the front features a built-in wardrobe, recessed lighting and ceiling coving.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.64m x 2.83m\nLooking over the front garden with recessed lights, a ceiling fan and coving.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.51m x 3.41m\nDouble bedroom to the rear features a built-in wardrobe and carpet flooring.\n\nBathroom - 5.24m x 2.61m\nBathroom is fully tiled, has a heated chrome towel rail, a bath, WC, wash hand basin, a Triton T90sr shower and recessed lighting.\n\nAttic Space - 4.50m x 4.22m\nFeatures laminate flooring, recessed lighting, two skylights, eve storage, a brick wall and a fan.\n\n"
      },
      {
